    "details": "<p><strong> OFFICIAL REGISTRATION:</strong><br />Registrations are conducted directly on our official festival portal:<br /><strong><a href=\"https://shouryacse.com/events/hackathon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Register Here: https://shouryacse.com/events/hackathon</a></strong></p>\n<h3>ABOUT THIS EVENT</h3>\n<p><strong>An intense product sprint where teams turn bold ideas into working prototypes. Problem statements will be provided on the spot, with mentor checkpoints along the way and a final jury pitch.</strong></p>\n<h3>EVENT DETAILS &amp; FORMAT</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fee:</strong> ₹299 / head</li>\n<li><strong>Format:</strong> Build + pitch</li>\n<li><strong>Prize Pool:&nbsp;</strong>Worth ₹ 4L+</li>\n<li><strong>Team Size:</strong> 2&ndash;4 members</li>\n<li><strong>Date:</strong> 16 &amp; 17 &middot; Day 1 &amp; 2 (October 2026)</li>\n<li><strong>Time:</strong> 10 AM &ndash; 10 AM next day (24-Hour Continuous Hackathon)</li>\n<li><strong>Venue:</strong> CSE Labs 2, 3, 4, 5, MVSR Engineering College</li>\n<li><strong>Food:</strong> Provided &middot; No extra charge</li>\n<li><strong>Official Registration:</strong> <a href=\"https://shouryacse.com/events/hackathon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Register Team Now</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>EVENT Coordinators</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Aniketh - </strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">+91 8309012359</span></li>\n<li><strong>Sana - </strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">+91 9100903450</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"eyebrow event-performer-label\"><strong>WHAT WE OFFER</strong></p>\n<ol class=\"event-activities\">\n<li>₹4 lakh+ prize pool</li>\n<li>25+ internship opportunities</li>\n<li>ISRO scientist and industry expert interactions</li>\n<li>Exclusive AI tools and learning opportunities</li>\n<li>Food and refreshments throughout the hackathon</li>\n<li>Drinks, snacks, dinner and breakfast</li>\n<li>Electrifying musical night</li>\n<li>Exciting goodies, certificates and recognition</li>\n<li>Mentorship, networking and real-world problem solving</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>GUIDELINES</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to all college students.</li>\n<li>Teams of 2 to 4 members. Inter-college and inter-branch teams are allowed.</li>\n<li>High-speed internet, power backup, food, and dedicated lab space are provided.</li>\n<li>Mentorship checkpoints throughout the sprint followed by a live prototype evaluation pitch before the jury.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://shouryacse.com/events/hackathon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Click Here to Register Your Team on shouryacse.com/events/hackathon</a></strong></p>",
